# UI Components

## Shared Shell (index.html & legal.html)

```html
<body class="site-shell">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="uk-offcanvas-content">
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="site-container">
        <nav class="uk-navbar-container site-nav" uk-navbar aria-label="Main navigation">...</nav>
      </div>
      <div id="offcanvas-nav-primary" uk-offcanvas="overlay: true">...</div>
    </header>
    <main id="main-content" class="site-main">...</main>
  </div>
  <footer class="footer" id="legalFooter">...</footer>
</body>
```

## Navigation

- Hamburger: `uk-toggle="target: #offcanvas-nav-primary"` with `aria-label="Open menu"`
- Centered logo: `uk-navbar-item uk-logo site-logo`
- Close button inside offcanvas: `uk-offcanvas-close` with `aria-label="Close menu"`
- Sidebar links: `uk-nav uk-nav-primary uk-nav-center uk-margin-auto-vertical`
- Legal anchors: `legal.html#terms`, `legal.html#privacy`

## Homepage Hero

```html
<header class="site-hero">
  <h1 class="site-title">Rohit Gupta</h1>
  <p class="site-tagline">Developer, traveller, and blogger — three sides of one journey.</p>
</header>
```

## Persona Cards (index.html)

Use a responsive grid with height-matched cards:

```html
<section class="persona-grid uk-child-width-1-1 uk-child-width-1-3@m" uk-grid uk-height-match="target: .persona-card" aria-label="About me">
  <div>
    <article class="uk-card uk-card-default persona-card">
      <div class="uk-card-media-top">
        <a class="card-image-link" href="...">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="rohit-developer.webp" type="image/webp">
            <img src="rohit-developer.jpg" alt="..." width="400" height="400" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
          </picture>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="uk-card-body">
        <h2 class="uk-card-title">Title</h2>
        <p class="card-description">...</p>
        <p class="card-meta">...</p>
        <p class="card-links"><a href="...">Link</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
```

All three cards use `uk-card-media-top` (image above content on all breakpoints).

## Legal Page (legal.html)

- Content wrapper: `<div class="site-container legal-content">`
- Page header: `.page-header` with `h1`, description, `.legal-updated` date
- Sections: `<section id="terms">`, `#privacy`, `#disclaimer` with semantic `h2` / `h3`
- Red/green link colors scoped to `.legal-content a:link` / `a:visited`

## Footer

- **index.html:** Single link to `legal.html`
- **legal.html:** `.footer-inner` with `Back to Home`, `Terms of Use`, `Privacy Policy` separated by `.footer-separator`
- Background `#efefef`; flex shell pins footer to bottom

## Conventions

- External links: `target="_top"` with `rel="noopener"`
- Always include `<meta charset="utf-8">`, viewport meta, and `meta name="description"`
- Images: WebP via `<picture>`, explicit `width`/`height`, `loading="lazy"` for below-fold
- LCP image (developer card): `fetchpriority="high"`, preloaded in `<head>`
- Scripts: UIkit JS deferred at end of `<body>`
